Z||000000||Lady Pegasus||12-09-2001||07:26 PM||||With all the decorations being put up in houses around... I was just wondering.  What is your favorite ornament?  Or your favorite decoration to put up for whatever holidays you celebrate?  Mine would have to be an ornament I got when I was about 7.  My aunt and uncle gave me a small velvet unicorn with a satin red bow around it's neck.  The ornament was so tiny, and it was always the first one on the tree and the last one packed up when the holidays are over.  But alas, my ornament is no longer.  There was a small fire at my house and when the cleaning crew came threw, they trashed a bunch of stuff and my ornaments were one of them.  But I will always have the sweet memory of my favorite ornament.  Just wondering if there are similar stories out there. <P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||5
